                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>During the rest of 1949, the problems of the Berlin railroad workers continued to
                    be a matter of quadripartite discussion. For documentation on these discussions,
                    see <ref target="#pg361">pages 361</ref> ff.</p>
